                                HAMLOG VERSION

               HAMLOG is a Amateur Radio Logging program for use on the
                             PSION series 3 organiser.

FILE        USE        INSTALLATION
===========================================================================
HAML3 .OPO  SERIES 3   COPY TO APP DIRECTORY AND INSTALL USING PSION-I
HAMLOG.OPA  SERIES 3A  COPY TO APP DIRECTORY AND INSTALL USING PSION-I.

